post_install() {
  cat <<EOF

Copy your GOG installs of Magic Carpet Plus and/or Magic Carpet 2 to
~/.local/share/mgcarpet/gamedata/, or set the "gamedata" key of
~/.config/mgcarpet/mgcarpet.json to the absolute path of an install or of their parent directory
(see /usr/share/doc/mgcarpet/gamedata.md).
The game data is converted on first start, and after upgrades that change the converted format.
EOF
}
